  "actions": [
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "free",
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day;</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Imeckus hasn't yet acted on his turn and Lintwerth is in an adjacent square</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Imeckus draws power from his bond with his familiar. During his turn, he gains the ability to cast one spell he prepared today and already cast, without spending a spell slot. He must still Cast the Spell and meet the spell's other requirements.</p>",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "day"
      },
      "name": "Drain Lintwerth",
      "requirements": "Imeckus hasn't yet acted on his turn and Lintwerth is in an adjacent square",
      "traits": [
        "arcane"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "free",
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> If Imeckus's next action is to cast a cantrip or spell that is 4th level or lower, reduce the number of actions to cast it by 1 (minimum 1 action).</p>",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "day"
      },
      "name": "Quickened Casting",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "spellshape"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "interaction",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p>Imeckus calls out Lintwerth's name and snaps his fingers, causing his dust mephit familiar (and up to 1 Bulk of objects carried by Lintwerth) to instantly transport to an adjacent square of Imeckus' choice, providing Lintwerth is within a mile.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Recall Lintwerth",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "teleportation"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "interaction",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>Imeckus Stroon's familiar Lintwerth is a loyal companion and is a bit more powerful than the standard familiar in that he does not possess the minion trait; Imeckus can direct Lintwerth's actions verbally as a free action. If Lintwerth is slain, Imeckus becomes Drained 1 for 24 hours.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Enhanced Familiar",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "defensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>If a reaction would disrupt Imeckus's spellcasting action, he attempts a @Check[flat|dc:15]; if he succeeds, his action isn't disrupted.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Steady Spellcasting",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    }
  ],
